1. Store
a. @app.get("/store") - To fetch the store list values
b. @app.post("/store") - Add new store name
c. @app.get("/store/<string:store_id>") - To fetch the specific store name from the store list
d. @app.delete("/store/<string:store_id>") - To delete the specific store from the store list


2. Items
a. @app.post("/item")
b. @app.get("/item")
c. @app.get("/item/<string:item_id>")
d. @app.delete("/item/<string:item_id>")
e. @app.put("/item/<string:item_id>")



